Requirement Description:
This TF-1 replaces the 3343 lead decon facility project that was previously submitted. Demil plans to utilize a portable trailer at 3345

for the employees at 3343 to use. Utility hookups and concrete pad are needed. The attachments show a similar trailer that is used;

however, the end users might require a larger one.

