Requirement Description:
Item1:

Replace all fixtures inside building 510 with LED technology. There are over 100 fixtures in the hangars and over 80 fixtures in the office areas that need to be upgraded.

There have been discussions with Antonino Piluso for this upgrade.  Pictures and details have already been provided to Mr. Piluso.



Item2:

1) Pressure Wash of the external wall made with insulating panels;

2) Re-paint the part of the external wall made with plaster;

3) Renovation of the walls facade of the mechanical yards 

     approximately 250 square meters.

4) Install #2 Logo Signage (ea. 3 meter diameter) on the top of

     the Hangar Bay doors on the South Side; 





Item3:

1) Remove and disposal the existing fire door and install a new one;

2) Replace the three locks on the external fire doors of the Mechanical yard 1-2. 





Item4:

Re-paint the interior office space walls;

Remove the existing Carpet Tiles;

Supply and installation of Ceramic Flooring;

Supply and installation of skirting boards.

