Requirement Description:
1. structure must be designed to withstand at least 110 mph winds;

2. Structure must be covered by a tension fabric or other similar fire rated material with a minimum twenty (20) year warranty;

3. Concrete blocks, jersey barriers or other similar material must be placed around the interior of the structure to protect the side walls during loading and unloading de-icing materials;

4. the design must prevent stormwater run-on and run through;

5. Structure must be erected on an impermeable slab;

6. structure cannot be open sided

